<p><a href="http://pngu.mgh.harvard.edu/~purcell/plink/">Plink</a> is a powerful whole 
genome analysis program with nearly 100 options.  Building an analysis option-by-option
can be difficult, so we've designed a tool called Plinkomatic to walk you through the
process.  It will ask you three sets of questions, then give you a 
<a href="http://pngu.mgh.harvard.edu/~purcell/plink/download.shtml">command</a> 
you can copy and paste into a terminal window.
</p>

